        f"Chủ đề: <b>{html.escape(topic)}</b>\n\n"
        "<b>1️⃣ Gợi ý video 5 giây</b>\n"
        f"<code>{html.escape(prompts[0])}</code>\n\n"
        "<b>2️⃣ Gợi ý video 10 giây</b>\n"
        f"<code>{html.escape(prompts[1])}</code>\n\n"
